  "definition": "CPRA = (keymatchcount \\times 3) + (COUNT(DISTINCT mktref) \\times 10) + (WRI \\times 0.2) + (\\frac{mktspan}{365} \\times 5) - (\\frac{compliancescore}{20}), \\text{where WRI is defined by the Wallet Risk Index, platformcount is the count of distinct markets an entity operates on, and higher values indicate greater cross-platform risk.}"
}

{
