  "definition": "VTI = \\frac{vendsucccount}{vendtxcount} \\times 100 - \\frac{venddisputecount}{vendtxcount} \\times 50 + (vendrate \\times 5), \\text{where higher scores indicate more trustworthy vendors.}"
}

{
